# Copy to .env (factory init creates an empty one). .env is gitignored; never commit it.
#
# Both profiles default to OpenAI Pi. Authenticate Pi with the selected provider separately.
# Only the Anthropic family uses pi-claude-subscription and Claude Code.
# See orchestrator/ADAPTING.md for provider setup; never put credentials in an image.
# For that family, the user supplies a container token from `claude setup-token`.
# Leave this empty unless the Anthropic family is explicitly selected.
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
